  "effectiveDate": "2022-11-11",
  "historyNote": "#7923, eff 7-24-03; ss by #9939, INTERIM, eff 6-9-11, EXPIRED: 12-6-11 New. #10130, eff 5-18-12; renumbered by #12603 (formerly Ed 507.34); ss by #13485, eff 11-11-22",
